Name: quic_idle_timeout
Type: DURATION
Default-Value: 5m
Default-Unit: m
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

Set the QUIC idle timeout for HTTP/3 connections, i.e. the length of time
a QUIC connection may go without any network activity before the server
closes it.  This is independent of, and not affected by, httptimeout or
httpkeepalive, which apply only to HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2 connections over TCP.
